{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 23, "data": [{"docid2": 2215213, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/gzhd/jyta/202606/t20260611_2215213.htm", "content": "\n明教办函〔2026〕80号 \n冯素萍委员：\n《关于提升孤独症儿童融合教育水平的建议》（第20264016号）由我局会同市残联、市卫健委办理。现将有关情况汇总答复如下：\n近年来，我市认真贯彻落实国家、省、市关于孤独症", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/gzhd/jyta/202606/t20260611_2215213.htm", "docreltime": "2026.06.11 08:41:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于市政协十一届五次会议第20264016号提案的答复", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教办函〔2026〕80号", "idxid": "SM00104-0600-2026-00081", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2026.05.29 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 2486034, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/gzhd/jyta/202606/t20260611_2215213.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/gzhd/jyta/202606/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2190432, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/zwzx/gsgg/202602/t20260202_2187724.htm", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/zwzx/gsgg/202602/t20260202_2187724.htm", "docreltime": "2026.02.13 14:51:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局　三明市人力资源和社会保障局关于做好2025年中小学幼儿园教师职称评审工作的通知", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2399007, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/zwzx/gsgg/202602/t20260202_2187724.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2179576, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jyzx/smjy/202512/t20251224_2179142.htm", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jyzx/smjy/202512/t20251224_2179142.htm", "docreltime": "2025.12.26 09:23:00", "doctitle": "我市召开特殊教育工作座谈会", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2386148, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://smjy.sm.gov.cn/jyzx/smjy/202512/t20251224_2179142.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2125468, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202505/t20250526_2125468.htm", "content": "\n　　5月20日上午，以“点亮星灯·职业教育赋能特殊学生社会融合”为主题的三明市第三届特殊教育学生生活与职业技能竞赛暨教学研讨活动，在三明市特殊教育学校举行。活动吸引了全市特殊教育教师及学生代表等共200余人", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202505/t20250526_2125468.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.22 09:39:00", "doctitle": "三明市第三届特殊教育学生生活与职业技能竞赛暨教学研讨活动成功举办", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2322086, "sourcename": "市教育局办公室", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202505/t20250526_2125468.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2108344, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202503/t20250320_2108344.htm", "content": "\n　　明教初〔2024〕149号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局，三明教育学院，市直属学校：\n　　    根据《三明市教育局关于开展三明市中小学科学教育特色学校遴选工作的通知》（明教初〔2024〕126号）和《三明市教育局关于印", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202503/t20250320_2108344.htm", "docreltime": "2024.11.22 15:03:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于确认三明市首批中小学科学教育特色学校的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教初〔2024〕149号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2024-00144", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2024.11.18 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 2302507, "sourcename": "三明市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202503/t20250320_2108344.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1975392, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202311/t20231115_1975392.htm", "content": "\n　　明教初〔2023〕103号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局、残疾人联合会,三明市特殊教育学校：\n　　根据国家和省、市有关招生工作要求，现就做好三明市特殊教育学校2023年秋季招生工作有关事项通知如下：\n　　一、招生对", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202311/t20231115_1975392.htm", "docreltime": "2023.06.19 16:03:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局　三明市残疾人联合会关于三明市特殊教育学校2023年秋季招生的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教初〔2023〕103号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2023-00127", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2023.06.16 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 2139942, "sourcename": "三明市教育局01", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202311/t20231115_1975392.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1-2.docx", "appdocid": 1975392, "appfile": "P020231115409102827428.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202311/t20231115_1975392.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202311/P020231115/P020231115409102827428.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202311/P020231115409102827428.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202311/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2010244, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202403/t20240318_2010244.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，省教育厅印发了《福建省教育厅关于加强残疾儿童少年义务教育阶段随班就读工作的通知》（以下简称《通知》），现解读如下：\n　　一、起草背景\n　　特殊教育始终是党和政府高度重视和关心的一项民生事业。加", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202403/t20240318_2010244.htm", "docreltime": "2023.06.07 15:41:00", "doctitle": "《福建省教育厅关于加强残疾儿童少年义务教育阶段随班就读工作的通知》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2182502, "sourcename": "福建省教育厅", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202403/t20240318_2010244.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202403/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1906323, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/t20230517_1906323.htm", "content": "\n　　各市、县(区)财政局、教育局，平潭综合实验区财政金融局、社会事业局：\n　　为进一步落实特教学校残疾学生补助经费，经研究，现下达你市、县（区）2023年特教学校“两免一补”经费    万元，其中：免除学杂费资", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/t20230517_1906323.htm", "docreltime": "2023.05.17 18:46:00", "doctitle": "福建省财政厅 福建省教育厅关于下达2023年特教学校“两免一补”补助资金的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2056712, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/t20230517_1906323.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "2023年特教学校“两免一补”资金安排表.xls", "appdocid": 1906323, "appfile": "P020230517677137186880.xls", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/t20230517_1906323.htm", "fileext": "xls", "_src": "/protect/P0202305/P020230517/P020230517677137186880.xls", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/P020230517677137186880.xls"}, {"appdesc": "专项转移支付绩效目标表.xls", "appdocid": 1906323, "appfile": "P020230517677137366035.xls", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/t20230517_1906323.htm", "fileext": "xls", "_src": "/protect/P0202305/P020230517/P020230517677137366035.xls", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/P020230517677137366035.xls"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202305/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1874860, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/t20230120_1874860.htm", "content": "\n　　为深入贯彻落实党的二十大精神和《“十四五”特殊教育发展提升行动计划》，遵循特殊教育规律，以适宜融合为目标，坚持尊重差异、多元融合，让学生在融合环境中相互理解尊重、共同成长进步，自2021年以来，三明市", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/t20230120_1874860.htm", "docreltime": "2023.01.06 10:14:00", "doctitle": "【教改系列报道】三明市特殊教育学校：融爱倾心 合众同行", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2018525, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/t20230120_1874860.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1874859, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/t20230120_1874859.htm", "content": "\n　　为贯彻落实国务院办公厅转发教育部等七部门《“十四五”特殊教育发展提升行动计划》，近日，省教育厅会同省直有关部门联合制定印发《福建省“十四五”特殊教育发展提升行动方案》（以下简称《行动方案》），现解", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/t20230120_1874859.htm", "docreltime": "2022.12.16 16:13:00", "doctitle": "关于《福建省“十四五”特殊教育发展提升行动方案》政策解读", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2018524, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/t20230120_1874859.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202301/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1804694, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804694.htm", "content": "\n　　明教中〔2022〕102号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局，市直属有关学校（单位）：\n　　根据《福建省教育厅关于严格执行中小学校历和作息时间有关规定的通知》（闽教基〔2008〕60号）精神和要求，结合我市实际，现将三", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804694.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.01 10:34:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于2022—2023学年度中小学校历安排的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教中〔2022〕102号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00148", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.06.30 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1932145, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804694.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1804688, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804688.htm", "content": "\n　　明教安〔2022〕99号\n　　各县（市、区）教育局，各大中专院校、市直属学校：\n　　2022年暑假即将来临，为防范各类学生伤害事故，加强暑期学校安全防范，确保师生安全，现就做好2022年暑期学校安全工作有关事项通", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804688.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.01 10:29:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于做好2022年暑期学校安全工作的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教安〔2022〕99号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00147", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.06.29 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1932139, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804688.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1804682, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804682.htm", "content": "\n　　明教思〔2022〕95号\n　　各县(市、区)教育局，市直属学校：\n　　2022年是党的二十大召开之年，是实施“十四五”规划、开启全面建设社会主义现代化国家新征程的重要一年。习近平总书记在致信祝贺首届全民阅读大会", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804682.htm", "docreltime": "2022.07.01 10:21:00", "doctitle": "三明市教育局关于开展2022年三明市师生“暑期读一本好书”活动的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明教思〔2022〕95号", "idxid": "SM00104-0200-2022-00146", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "2022.06.24 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市教育局", "recid": 1932133, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804682.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1804682, "appfile": "P020220707321014527069.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/t20220707_1804682.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202207/P020220707/P020220707321014527069.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/P020220707321014527069.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202207/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1796897, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202206/t20220614_1796897.htm", "content": "\n　　有关市、县(区)财政局、教育局,平潭综合实验区财政金融局、 社会事业局:\n　　为进一步推动我省特殊教育发展,根据省特殊教育年度工作 重点,现下达你市、县(区)2022年特殊教育补助经费 _ _万元(具体项目及金额详见", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202206/t20220614_1796897.htm", "docreltime": "2022.06.14 16:31:00", "doctitle": "福建省财政厅福建省教育厅关于下达2022年特殊教育补助资金的通知（闽财教指〔2022〕51号）", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1923134, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202206/t20220614_1796897.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件.docx", "appdocid": 1796897, "appfile": "P020220614598492494205.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202206/t20220614_1796897.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202206/P020220614/P020220614598492494205.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202206/P020220614598492494205.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202206/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1781022, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202204/t20220427_1781022.htm", "content": "　　福建省坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入贯彻落实党中央、国务院关于特殊教育的有关决策部署，把办好特殊教育作为促进教育公平、推进教育现代化、建设教育强省的重要内容，加快健全特殊教育体", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202204/t20220427_1781022.htm", "docreltime": "2022.04.27 07:46:00", "doctitle": "福建省“六措并举”强赋能 努力推进特殊教育高质量发展", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1904795, "sourcename": "市教育局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202204/t20220427_1781022.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202204/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1761718, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "特殊教育", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202203/t20220302_1761718.htm", "content": "\n　　近日，教育部、发改委等部门发布《“十四五”特殊教育发展提升行动计划》，指出“继续对家庭经济困难残疾学生实行高中阶段免费教育，确保家庭经济困难残疾学生优先获得资助，逐步提高特殊教育经费保障水平”“切", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/jy/tsjy_1103/202203/t20220302_1761718.htm", "docreltime": "2022.02.24 08:18:00", "doctitle": "《“十四五”特殊教育发展提升行动计划》发布，家庭经济困难残疾学生优先资助", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "pubor